<section><h2 class="ref-sec-title">Events</h2><ol class="day-events yr-events"><li class="tih-event-card tih-has-thumb"><a class="tih-event-thumb" href="/encyclopedia/theodosius-i" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/theodosius-i.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="168" height="112"></a><div class="tih-event-main"><p class="tih-event-year"><a href="/today-in-history/october-3">3 October</a></p><h3 class="tih-event-title">Theodosius I settles the Goths inside the Roman Empire</h3><p class="tih-event-desc">Emperor <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theodosius-i">Theodosius I</a> concluded a treaty allowing the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/goths">Goths</a> to settle south of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/danube">Danube</a> as semi-autonomous allies. Giving a whole people land within the frontier set a precedent that reshaped the late Roman world.</p><div class="tih-tags"><a class="tih-tag tih-tag-profile" href="/empire/roman-empire">Roman Empire</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/theodosius-i">Theodosius I</a><a class="tih-tag enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/danube">Danube</a></div></div></li></ol></section>
